# 5.7 Full Database Restore Test

To avoid risking the original production-like `DataWarehouse` database, a separate recovery database was created:

```text
DataWarehouse_RecoveryTest
```

The backup was then restored into this database using:

```bash
pg_restore
```

This provided an isolated recovery environment.

### Recovery architecture

```text
                  Original Database
                  DataWarehouse
                        │
                        │ pg_dump
                        ▼
              DataWarehouse_backup.dump
                        │
                        │ pg_restore
                        ▼
             DataWarehouse_RecoveryTest
```

This approach allowed the restoration process to be tested without modifying or destroying the original warehouse.

